{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 840.0, 596.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [22.6802978515625, 14.259765625, 230.4658203125, 30.39630126953125], "text": "Chapter 2.2 Museums Visit Bergen Bergen Guide 2022", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [22.599609375, 40.8876953125, 39.744140625, 56.8935546875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [39.78515625, 46.271484375, 241.65306091308594, 56.25628662109375], "text": "THE HANSEATIC MUSEUM AND SCH\u00d8TSTUENE", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [21.73828125, 62.568359375, 290.89874267578125, 96.0748291015625], "text": "Explore Bryggen as the Hanseatic merchants knew it! Visit the German merchants' assembly rooms, Sch\u00f8tstuene, and UNESCO World Heritage site Bryggen with us. Guided tours are available in several languages in the summer season.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [22.677200317382812, 96.03515625, 186.0106201171875, 104.57232666015625], "text": "Activities for children and seats in the garden.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [22.55859375, 118.734375, 172.1972198486328, 134.92727661132812], "text": "\u00d8vregaten 50 / NO-5003 / +47 53 00 61 10 / hanseatiskemuseum.museumvest.no/", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [18.78515625, 139.1927734375, 38.63671875, 156.4791015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [41.42578125, 138.232421875, 63.57421874999999, 153.947265625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [44.296875, 138.814453125, 70.546875, 155.693359375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [258.80859375, 138.17421875, 285.87890625, 158.66171875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [300.234375, 44.525390625, 383.90625, 155.693359375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [21.73828125, 173.154296875, 217.17385864257812, 191.61065673828125], "text": "EDVARD GRIEG MUSEUM TROLDHAUGEN 23", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [22.55859375, 195.271484375, 276.2655029296875, 231.42922973632812], "text": "World-famous composer Edvard Grieg's villa at Troldhaugen has been preserved as it was in 1907. The museum also includes the composer's cabin, his burial site, a concert hall, and a museum. Daily concerts from 15 June to 21 August enable visitors to hear Grieg's music in the setting", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [21.73828125, 259.5859375, 240.06227111816406, 269.9252624511719], "text": "Troldhaugveien 65 / NO-5232 / +47 930 19 590 / troldhaugen.no", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [19.27734375, 272.97265625, 41.42578125, 292.76171875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [38.14453125, 273.5546875, 65.21484375, 291.015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [48.3984375, 275.591796875, 68.0859375, 291.306640625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [59.47265624999999, 275.591796875, 76.69921875, 292.470703125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [22.677200317382812, 232.42672729492188, 104.39646911621094, 239.92672729492188], "text": "in which it was written.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [74.6484375, 275.591796875, 100.89843749999999, 292.470703125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [24.165699005126953, 311.5904296875, 92.44921875, 326.9649353027344], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [22.1484375, 331.7578125, 286.7520446777344, 366.7835388183594], "text": "Fjell Fort is situated in a popular walking area around 25 km from Bergen. As one of the most important strongholds built in Norway during WWII, it guarded Bergen from attacks from the west. Much of the fort has been very well preserved. Guided tours inside the fort are available at set times.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [22.677099227905273, 398.109375, 277.08587646484375, 405.27952575683594], "text": "Festningsvegen / NO-5357 / +47 53 00 61 23 / fjellfestning.museumvest.no/", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [19.6875, 408.876953125, 41.015625, 428.083984375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [40.1953125, 408.876953125, 59.88281249999999, 426.919921875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [61.93359374999999, 410.623046875, 80.80078125, 428.666015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [62.75390624999999, 412.66015625, 83.26171875, 427.79296875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [77.109375, 412.079345703125, 101.71874999999999, 428.95703125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [35.2734375, 451.07421875, 139.46690368652344, 462.71484375], "text": "OLD BERGEN MUSEUM", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [22.1484375, 469.1171875, 291.5369873046875, 510.6353530883789], "text": "Enjoy a bit of nostalgia delving into the history of a living museum in the reconstructed Bergen of the 19th and 20th centuries. The museum has a unique collection of around 50 original wooden buildings that once stood in the centre of Bergen. There is also a beautiful English-style park and a seawater pool.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [22.55859375, 533.6339302062988, 275.86724853515625, 540.70703125], "text": "Nyhavnsveien 4 / NO-5042 / +47 55 30 80 34 / 55 30 80 30 / bymuseet.no/", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [22.1484375, 546.52734375, 45.1171875, 561.66015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [36.09375, 547.69140625, 59.06249999999999, 562.82421875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [38.96484375, 547.4336585998535, 66.03515625, 566.025390625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [301.0546875, 48.30859375, 383.0859375, 174.02734375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [300.234375, 168.20703125, 388.82812499999994, 281.12109375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [294.615234375, 300.91015625, 391.166015625, 428.95703125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [296.70703125, 434.9810546875, 392.35546874999994, 564.9486328125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [452.97656249999994, 13.910546875, 485.46093749999994, 30.39630126953125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [538.890869140625, 14.893798828125, 575.0390625, 30.39630126953125], "text": "Bergen Guide 2022", "type": "Caption"}, {"bbox": [618.515625, 12.513671875, 661.3313598632812, 30.39630126953125], "text": "Chapter 2.2 Museums", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [449.08007812499994, 40.9458984375, 468.02929687499994, 55.6712890625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [471.401611328125, 44.81640625, 656.1312255859375, 56.25616455078125], "text": "HARALD S\u00c6VERUD \u2013 MUSEUM SILJUST\u00d8L", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [451.99218749999994, 61.404296875, 714.8048706054688, 104.57232666015625], "text": "Siljust\u00f8l was home of the popular composer Harald S\u00e6verud and his wife Marie. The house, with its studio and grand piano, are preserved as they were when S\u00e6verud died in 1992. The house is now a museum set in a beautiful area covering 44 acres, which is perfect for walks. Welcome to this unique composer's home where the focus is on music and nature.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [451.99218749999994, 126.009765625, 649.3753662109375, 134.57095336914062], "text": "Siljust\u00f8lveien 50 / NO-5236 / +47 55 92 29 92 / siljustol.no", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [451.99218749999994, 137.94140625, 476.60156249999994, 155.40234375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [460.60546874999994, 139.396484375, 484.39453124999994, 156.275390625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [723.10546875, 37.308203125, 822.3632812499999, 164.074609375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [446.66015624999994, 174.900390625, 470.44921874999994, 191.779296875], "text": "27", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [464.29687499999994, 179.265625, 550.1201171875, 191.61065673828125], "text": "HERDLA MUSEUM", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [451.58203124999994, 196.14453125, 718.4273681640625, 239.92672729492188], "text": "A small island with its own museum, Herdla is situated in the archipelago west of Bergen. It has exhibitions about its dramatic role in World War II, and its rich fauna and birdlife. The main attraction is a German fighter aircraft from WWII. Herdla is also a great place for walks, fishing, swimming and bird-watching.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [447.28320312499994, 260.40078125, 701.154296875, 269.9252624511719], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [446.82421874999994, 272.3033203125, 470.28515624999994, 293.4310546875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [477.01171874999994, 273.263671875, 495.87890624999994, 290.142578125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [490.95703124999994, 275.8828125, 506.54296874999994, 291.015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [502.85156249999994, 276.173828125, 530.7421875, 291.888671875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [449.12109374999994, 308.185546875, 467.98828124999994, 326.2142639160156], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [466.75781249999994, 315.751953125, 542.9290771484375, 326.9649353027344], "text": "HAAKON'S HALL", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [452.40234374999994, 333.50390625, 719.6130981445312, 366.7835388183594], "text": "Experience a 13th-century royal banqueting hall, the first of its kind to be built in stone. Haakon's Hall was the largest and most imposing building of the royal residency in Bergen, and is now a living national cultural heritage site. Imagine what being a king was like in the Middle Ages.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [453.5433044433594, 396.9453125, 721.0413818359375, 405.27952575683594], "text": "Bergenhus Festning / NO-5003 / +47 55 30 80 36 / 55 30 80 30 / bymuseet.no/", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [449.12109374999994, 411.205078125, 469.62890624999994, 428.083984375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [467.16796874999994, 410.9140625, 484.39453124999994, 427.2109375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [479.88281249999994, 412.079345703125, 499.57031249999994, 426.337890625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [675.03515625, 414.9591796875, 694.88671875, 447.6111328125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [721.177734375, 308.673828125, 817.7285156249999, 435.162109375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [446.24999999999994, 448.4259765625, 470.85937499999994, 461.8708984375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [470.85937499999994, 453.40234375, 616.3776245117188, 462.31919860839844], "text": "KODE ART MUSEUMS OF BERGEN", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [452.81249999999994, 469.14534759521484, 724.0524291992188, 519.1328506469727], "text": "Norway's second biggest art collection is housed in four museums in the heart of the city. See art and design from the 15th century up to the present. The museums feature the works of artists such as Munch, Dahl, Klee and Picasso. Dedicated KunstLab section for children with a workshop and exhibition. Separate programme of changing exhibitions. One ticket for all the museums.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [453.22265624999994, 524.701171875, 661.6743774414062, 540.777530670166], "text": "Rasmus Meyers all\u00e8 3, 7 og 9. Nordahl Bruns gate 9 / NO-5015 +47 53 00 97 04 / kodebergen.no", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [448.30078124999994, 545.654296875, 470.44921874999994, 562.533203125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [461.42578124999994, 544.78125, 481.93359374999994, 562.2421875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [476.19140624999994, 546.236328125, 496.69921874999994, 563.115234375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [485.62499999999994, 546.52734375, 505.31249999999994, 562.82421875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [502.44140624999994, 547.4336585998535, 531.15234375, 561.66015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [727.001953125, 446.6216796875, 821.7480468749999, 563.7845703125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [22.677200317382812, 572.427734375, 816.3811645507812, 581.3182649612427], "text": "30 31", "type": "Text"}], "doc_id": "Bergen-Brochure-en-2022-23.pdf", "page_index": 11, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/Bergen-Brochure-en-2022-23.pdf", "source": "marker"}